From f9ef0188b2d12ea4225497b184043594c6a72d10 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Mingyang Sun (Public)" <Mingyang.Sun@amd.com>
Date: Sat, 12 Sep 2026 10:33:57 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] HIP: enable native FP8 conversions for gfx1250-strict

amd_hip_fp8.h selects the hardware FP8 conversion fast path and the OCP
FP8 format by testing target predefines. gfx1250 is listed, but the
gfx1250-strict variant is not, and clang predefines a distinct macro for
it (__gfx1250_strict__, confirmed from the device-pass predefines).

As a result a gfx1250-strict build matches neither guard:

  HIP_FP8_CVT_FAST_PATH = 0   (software conversion expansion)
  HIP_FP8_TYPE_OCP      = 0
  HIP_FP8_TYPE_FNUZ     = 0   (no FP8 format selected at all)

Add the strict variant alongside gfx1250 in both guards. This only adds
a macro that is exclusively defined for gfx1250-strict, so no other
target changes behaviour. The compiler target is not aliased and the
strict ISA restrictions are untouched.

Measured on MI455X (gfx1250), ROCm 10.1.0 / HIP 7.16.26362, with a
standalone HIP reproducer (no RCCL), counting hardware FP8 conversion
instructions in the generated device ISA:

  gfx1250                      : 2  (v_cvt_pk_fp8_f32, v_cvt_f32_fp8_e32)
  gfx1250-strict, before       : 0
  gfx1250-strict, after        : 2  (parity with gfx1250)

Preprocessor state for gfx1250-strict after the change:
  HIP_FP8_CVT_FAST_PATH 0 -> 1
  HIP_FP8_TYPE_OCP      0 -> 1

This matches the change carried downstream in TheRock as
patches/amd-mainline/rocm-systems/0004-HIP-enable-gfx1250-strict-FP8-conversion-fast-path.patch
(ROCm/TheRock@5ea0abc); landing it here allows that carry-patch to be
dropped.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 projects/clr/hipamd/include/hip/amd_detail/amd_hip_fp8.h | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/projects/clr/hipamd/include/hip/amd_detail/amd_hip_fp8.h b/projects/clr/hipamd/include/hip/amd_detail/amd_hip_fp8.h
index 88afc35bda1..8b39dcc15cc 100644
--- a/projects/clr/hipamd/include/hip/amd_detail/amd_hip_fp8.h
+++ b/projects/clr/hipamd/include/hip/amd_detail/amd_hip_fp8.h
@@ -13,7 +13,7 @@
 #define _HIP_INCLUDE_HIP_AMD_DETAIL_HIP_FP8_H_
 
 #if (defined(__gfx942__) || defined(__gfx1200__) || defined(__gfx1201__) ||                        \
-     defined(__gfx950__) || defined (__gfx1250__)) &&                                              \
+     defined(__gfx950__) || (defined(__gfx1250__) || defined(__gfx1250_strict__))) &&              \
     __HIP_DEVICE_COMPILE__
 #define HIP_FP8_CVT_FAST_PATH 1
 #else
@@ -24,7 +24,7 @@
 #define HIP_FP8_TYPE_OCP 0
 #define HIP_FP8_TYPE_FNUZ 1
 #elif (defined(__gfx1200__) || defined(__gfx1201__) || defined(__gfx950__) ||                      \
-       defined(__gfx1250__)) &&                                                                    \
+       (defined(__gfx1250__) || defined(__gfx1250_strict__))) &&                                   \
        __HIP_DEVICE_COMPILE__
 #define HIP_FP8_TYPE_OCP 1
 #define HIP_FP8_TYPE_FNUZ 0
